平衡性是用脚想出来的？", "timestamp_created": 1717770409, "timestamp_updated": 1717770409, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.505813956260681152", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166866818", "author": {"steamid": "76561198328160589", "personaname": "鲨鱼辣椒不加辣", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198328160589/", "num_games_owned": 172, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 5929, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5929, "last_played": 1706665859, "avatar": "1191c81a57194f64acfcda94f0fd0cb94e92eff7"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "评分：★★★☆☆（30块钱的你还是比不过6块钱的L4D2）\n香：“COD”化手感，轻Rogue卡牌系统增加可玩性\n臭：内容少，模式少，卖我30我还是要说内容少，金枪没配件鸡肋", "timestamp_created": 1717769018, "timestamp_updated": 1717769018, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166861896", "author": {"steamid": "76561199075023445", "personaname": "泡沫一团", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199075023445/", "num_games_owned": 53, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 6412, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1965, "last_played": 1781267333, "avatar": "6f58eadc66769849db1d216d11d15cb3a4b5cd5a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好", "timestamp_created": 1717763233, "timestamp_updated": 1717763233, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166846944", "author": {"steamid": "76561199232915026", "personaname": "一下两下peek", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/52182037910/", "num_games_owned": 52, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2978, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 475, "last_played": 1736736832, "avatar": "d567cb1c556f3b9ef0a7e86c99b7d64748e833f3"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "战斗爽战斗爽战斗爽", "timestamp_created": 1717738188, "timestamp_updated": 1717738188, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166839765", "author": {"steamid": "76561198384226330", "personaname": "KLEX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198384226330/", "num_games_owned": 264, "num_reviews": 38, "playtime_forever": 1010, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1004, "last_played": 1743871715, "avatar": "dcc842540aede4b5e7d0963bd59ce22c7c406802"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏一般，上不去下不来的作品。素材重复利用极其严重，前几章几乎都在一个地方打，只不过是白天和黑夜的区别。到后面也几乎不想玩，游戏早已停止更新，对抗模式·也是极其无聊的坚守拖时间。40多块钱买终极版的话值得一试，不然任何情况都不推荐。", "timestamp_created": 1717726218, "timestamp_updated": 1717726218, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166811412", "author": {"steamid": "76561198100282659", "personaname": "鼠小杰", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198100282659/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 48, "playtime_forever": 1174, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 946, "last_played": 1719809497, "avatar": "68925eee2e740efe14d61a7b3fec496947e1bc66"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "低难度割草爽不起来，高难度又单纯坐牢，强制组队，没有创意工坊，不如求生一根毛。虽然史低30块，不过也停止更新了，目前的内容感觉还是单薄。也就画面好一点，击杀、爆头等特效还是可以。\n特感主要四大类加上boss，低难度下单纯就是恶心，特感频率非常高而且贴脸刷，也基本比较不出不同特感区别，因为都没近身就突突死了。但是又缺乏快速反制的手段，弱点难打不说还可能带护甲，高难度时避免不了花大量精力应对，再配合尸潮时，就只觉得恶心难受。食人魔和破坏者沼泽怪的进攻方式比较单一，低难度木桩高难度压迫力过于强，加上非常强调卡牌的作用，导致没有一定卡牌基础就是非常难打，不像求生遛TANK。拿卡牌就需要先低难度肝，但是低难度玩起来又挺无聊的，非常影响游玩体验。\n枪械配件系统其实也挺败笔，或许给了搭配不同流派的空间，但是玩什么流派其实选卡牌时就基本决定了，然后死活就是没有你需要的武器/配件怎么办呢。如果无视配件效果，就单纯看星级选，那还要搞配件系统干什么呢。游戏节奏也挺快的，基本没什么时间慢慢挑选。\n消耗品存在感有点低，火瓶、胆汁罐的时间较短，战略作用变得很低，想升级也要看商店刷新还有队友，快捷物品的存在感基本只有开锁器最多再加个弹药箱。最后基本就带些高爆炸乌鸦或者对付boss。同样因为节奏快，设计这么多道具种类捡的时候要仔细看好累，我觉得完全可以精简一些。\n地图设计“四处漏风”，大部分机制点都没有后背安全的地点，也有许多的路口，而且特感直接就突脸基本也不太可能固定点位防守，这也导致煤气罐油桶这类战略地图道具也很鸡肋，我都懒得拿。可能这样更真实更有压迫感，不过就游戏体验上来说不算好。\n顺便吐槽下警报车不显眼，动不动就是报警门，弹药焦虑（不会觉得分弹药就是团队合作吧），还有恶心的沉睡者。\n7/10，史低买来玩一玩还是可以的。", "timestamp_created": 1717691885, "timestamp_updated": 1717723288, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.52173912525177002", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166807793", "author": {"steamid": "76561199479755009", "personaname": "青山", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199479755009/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 702, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 187, "last_played": 1777317755, "avatar": "e94709343e89e1f91dfb6bca43e48b40f990bfcf"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩", "timestamp_created": 1717688256, "timestamp_updated": 1717688256, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166760868", "author": {"steamid": "76561198964093531", "personaname": "FywOo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198964093531/", "num_games_owned": 141, "num_reviews": 49, "playtime_forever": 1905, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1820, "last_played": 1783534927, "avatar": "b16a707f9aee4f736d1e030f1bf79a133cc1155b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "玩着玩着有可能会直接死机自动重启的 玩你妈 低配机子别玩这狗屎作品 优化=♥♥♥♥", "timestamp_created": 1717623223, "timestamp_updated": 1717623223, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "166735827", "author": {"steamid": "76561198450410673", "personaname": "安心惑", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198450410673/", "num_games_owned": 123, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3627, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3452, "last_played": 1784520178, "avatar": "0f83bb3fde62e46541dbd9505fa3c5ca1e481031"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "\"三年之期已到，我龟岩今天就是要卡死大家\"", "timestamp_created": 1717597866, "timestamp_updated": 1717597866, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}